TI  - Delivery strategies for entomopathogenic fungi in crop pest management: a review
AU  - Beltrán‐Martí, Roberto
AU  - Garcerá, Cruz
AU  - Garrido‐Jurado, Inmaculada
AU  - Chueca, Patricia
