TI  - Biopesticides as an eco‐friendly approach to mosquitoes and their role in reducing transmission of vector‐borne disease: updates and prospects
AU  - Nehra, Rohit
AU  - Dhanda, Suman
AU  - Singh, Himmat
AU  - Bharti, Praveen Kumar
AU  - Singh, Kuldeep
